@ Index:   Problem 1, 38-year loan, solves PMT
@ Author:  Jaco Mostert, fm Duncan Murray's problem set
@ 38 years monthly at 5.25% on PV 270000, FV 0. Solves PMT.
LBL ‘P1’
  38
  12
  ×
  STO ‘NPPER’
  5.25
  STO ‘I%/a’
  270000
  STO ‘PV’
  0
  STO ‘PMT’
  0
  STO ‘FV’
  12
  STO ‘PPER/a’
  STO ‘CPER/a’
  ENDP
  PMT
  END
